    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>the following is an idea in R to a multiple-dimensional.array containing sub-matrices with <i>different</i></div><div>dimensions. </div><div><br></div><div>Lets consider a vector v, v with elements from 1 to 100, gs the dimensional sizes of the sub-matrices</div><div>in matrix form and n the sub-matrix we would like to access.</div><div><br></div><div>Call below returns the 3rd sub-matrix with dimension 2, 10:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">ragged</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">array</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">to</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">81</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">83</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">85</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">87</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">89</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">91</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">93</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">95</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">97</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">99</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">82</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">84</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">86</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">88</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">90</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">92</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">94</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">96</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">98</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre></span></pre></div><div>The coding in Stan is straightforward. However the code requires a copying of a sub-vector into a </div><div>matrix. In the programming language C this could easily be done by pointer arithmetic. </div><div>In Stan with Eigen Matrix library, I&#39;m not sure of  &quot;relabeling&quot; is supported.</div><div><br></div><div>Before coding this in Stan I&#39;d like to hear about the idea.</div><div><br></div><div>------</div><div><br></div><div>Update: added Stan code</div><div><br></div><div>Andre</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">ragged</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">array</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">to</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vector </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> gs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">gs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    stop</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;length of vector v must match group size in gs&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">gs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">||</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    stop</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;element size must be in 1 ... length(gs)&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  rb </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cumsum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">gs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  lb </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rb</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lb</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rb</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>ragged</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">array</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">to</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">matrix </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ms</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  gs </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ms</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ms</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ragged</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">array</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">to</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> gs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ms</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ms</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><div><div><br></div></div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
